## Extended Thinking

> **Opus 4.7, Opus 4.6, and Sonnet 4.6:** Use adaptive thinking. `budget_tokens` is removed on Opus 4.7 (400 if sent); deprecated on Opus 4.6 and Sonnet 4.6.
